<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντ-ωπός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with the eyes front, facing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντωπὰ βλέφαρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					564
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντωπὸς βλέψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.196
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὄψεως ἀντωπά</span>
			<i>front parts</i> of the face, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Im.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; <i>opposite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				10.14
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>full in the face,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.134
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); of an eagle, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἁλίω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ecphant.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.7.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>like,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>.</div>
